OL,3,GNEWSAFree Christmas parking rolled out
OL,4,Aby council
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree parking is being offered on a
OL,7,Fhandful of days in the run up to
OL,8,FChristmas.
OL,10,FMole Valley District Council (MVDC)
OL,11,Fsaid people can use its car parks
OL,12,Fwithout paying on the three Saturdays
OL,13,Fin December.
OL,15,FAll MVDC-owned car parks in Dorking,
OL,16,FAshtead and Bookham will offer 24-hour
OL,17,Ffree parking on 5, 12 and 19 December,
OL,18,Fit said.
OL,20,FThere will also be free parking in
OL,21,FLeatherhead on 28 November and 5
OL,22,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
